ere from 18 to 254 days. A typical habit took 66."},{"id":"i3","start":20.358,"end":23.983,"text":"Third, missing one day didn't break anything. The habit kept building anyway."},{"id":"i4","start":24.083,"end":28.346,"text":"And finally, what mattered was doing it most days, in the same situation. Not being perfect."},{"id":"s1","start":28.446,"end":32.317,"text":"So stop counting to twenty-one. Pick a time, keep it small, and forgive a missed day."},{"id":"c1","start":32.417,"end":37.089,"text":"That's why every streak comes with freezes for busy days. Go to teyro dot app, or just search Teyro."}],"lip":{"amp":[0,0,0,0.001,0.001,0.665,0.495,0.549,0.955,0.858,0.64,0.857,1,1,0.712,0.886,1,0.495,0.092,0.441,0.565,0.928,1,0.776,0.988,0.871,0.927,1,0.826,0.893,0.627,0.657,0.63,0.722,0.871,0.519,0.571,0.305,0.721,1,0.485,0.308,0.986,1,0.663,0.827,0.938,0.927,0.865,0.951,0.696,0.183,0.776,0.832,0.725,0.202,0.285,0.159,0.015,0.004,0.002,0.124,1,1,1,0.649,0.73,1,0.963,0.1,0.663,0.597,0.825,1,1,0.926,0.489,0.479,1,1,0.498,0.559,0.888,0.863,0.648,0.224,0.655,0.927,0.535,1,0.925,0.914,0.355,0.324,0.679,0.505,0.587,0.857,0.799,0.845,1,1,0.783,0.249,0.015,0.003,0,0,0.015,0.376,0.901,0.957,0.987,0.982,0.622,0.756,0.674,0.344,0.606,0.644,0.244,0.009,0.322,0.621,0.242,0.859,0.851,0.635,0.8,0.883,1,1,1,1,0.917,1,0.82,1,1,1,0.866,0.821,0.739,0.609,0.414,0.242,0.33,0.979,0.784,0.753,1,0.386,0.33,0.902,0.974,1,0.934,0.233,0.201,0.603,0.943,0.727,0.422,0.401,0.249,0.85,0.56,0.445,0.65,0.592,0.729,0.798,1,0.873,0.488,0.82,1,0.927,1,0.998,0.899,1,1,0.926,1,0.894,0.591,0.602,0.529,0.452,0.533,0.324,0.879,0.966,0.961,0.792,0.582,0.816,0.682,0.084,0.548,0.714,0.161,0.735,0.814,0.723,0.865,0.855,0.771,0.874,0.73,0.271,0.02,0.098,0.173,0.145,0.101,0.059,0.036,0.35,1,1,0.908,0.207,0.862,0.762,0.681,0.614,0.366,1,0.915,1,1,1,1,0.96,1,1,1,1,0.898,1,1,1,1,0.573,0.424,0.027,0.279,1,0.998,0.878,0.75,0.564,0.756,0.923,0.616,0.697,0.361,0.457,0.689,0.886,0.903,0.586,0.025,0.209,0.033,0.628,0.443,1,1,